  "extra_prompt": "You are booking for a funeral service. Be warm, respectful, and unhurried. Ask about the deceased's name, the family's wishes, whether it is burial or cremation, and whether a service is wanted. Ask about cultural or religious requirements. Quote prices only from the reference answers, and say the final price is confirmed at arrangement. Do not provide legal or estate advice.",
  "kb": [
    {
      "q": "How much does a funeral cost?",
      "a": "{price_note} Costs depend on the type of service, the casket, and the location. We confirm the full amount with you at the arrangement meeting.",
      "keywords": "cost,price,funeral,arrangement",
      "priority": 10
    },
    {
      "q": "What is a direct cremation?",
      "a": "A direct cremation is a cremation without a formal service beforehand. We can arrange a gathering afterwards if the family wants one.",
      "keywords": "direct cremation,no service,gathering",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer prepaid funerals?",
      "a": "Yes, we offer prepaid and pre-arranged funeral plans. Ask us what the plan covers and how payments work before you sign anything.",
      "keywords": "prepaid,plan,pre-arranged,payment",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you handle repatriation?",
      "a": "Yes, we arrange domestic and international repatriation. Timing and costs depend on the destination, and we confirm them in writing.",
      "keywords": "repatriation,overseas,transfer",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Can we have a viewing?",
      "a": "Yes, viewings can be arranged at our facility or at a chapel. Let us know your preferred time when you call.",
      "keywords": "viewing,chapel,facility",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you arrange culturally specific funerals?",
      "a": "Yes, we work with religious and cultural traditions. We ask about these at the first meeting so the service reflects your family's wishes.",
      "keywords": "culture,religious,tradition,service",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you help with the death certificate?",
      "a": "Yes, we guide you through the paperwork needed for the funeral, including what the death certificate requires.",
      "keywords": "death certificate,paperwork,documents",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you arrange graveside services?",
      "a": "Yes, we coordinate graveside and chapel services. We confirm the cemetery or chapel booking with you before the day.",
      "keywords": "graveside,cemetery,chapel",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you supply flowers?",
      "a": "Yes, we can arrange floral tributes. Tell us the colours or flowers the family prefers, and we will confirm the cost first.",
      "keywords": "flowers,tribute,colour",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do memorial services?",
      "a": "Yes, memorial services without a casket are available. They can be held at a chapel, a venue of your choice, or another place.",
      "keywords": "memorial,without casket,venue",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Can we personalise the service?",
      "a": "Yes, we help plan a personalised service with music, readings, and photo tributes. Bring your ideas to the arrangement meeting.",
      "keywords": "personalise,music,readings,photos",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer grief support?",
      "a": "Yes, we can refer you to grief support services and share resources. Ask us for the details when you call.",
      "keywords": "grief,support,referral,resources",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do pet cremation?",
      "a": "Yes, we offer pet cremation. Tell us about your pet, and we will confirm the process and cost.",
      "keywords": "pet,cremation,animal",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Are you available 24/7?",
      "a": "Call [24-hour phone number] at any time. We will talk you through the next steps, day or night.",
      "keywords": "24/7,after hours,call,phone",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Can we pay in instalments?",
      "a": "{payment_note} Ask us what payment options are available before we start the arrangements.",
      "keywords": "instalments,payment,plan",
      "priority": 8
    }
  ],
